{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415326","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415326","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1041532601:1":{"text":"Odie's my name. Nice to meet you!","source_cn":"阿德，我的名字——很高兴认识你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7E4B31E18E6C680","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041532602:1":{"text":"I don't know you.","source_cn":"我不认识你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFB3E94FB81C42AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041532603:1":{"text":"Well, we're fixing that right now, aren't we?","source_cn":"现在不就认识了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF781BDE82FB80151","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041532604:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041532605:1":{"text":"No need for the death stare, my friend! I'm here with an olive branch... for the sake of our soon-to-be legendary alliance!","source_cn":"卢卡兄弟，眼神别那么凶嘛！我在向你抛出友好的橄榄枝，为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26B06B3CF2D563D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041532606:1":{"text":"Got anything useful?","source_cn":"你很有用？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA46E7C530B4BF11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041532607:1":{"text":"Straight to the point! I like that. Every partnership needs some proof of value, doesn't it?","source_cn":"哎呀呀，您一针见血！的确，要打交道，证明自己有用最重要。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1302929CC4E6C2C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041532608:1":{"text":"Stick with me, and I'll make sure doors swing open. I've got eyes on bounty hunters, rival factions—you name it.","source_cn":"不是我自夸，小到什么锁都能撬开的万用钥匙，大到——比如...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5522F45C094A2094","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041532609:1":{"text":"Hmph. Sounds like Sinbad's job.","source_cn":"哼，和辛巴达那小子一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BBBC17B82446E2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041532610:1":{"text":"Another resourceful type? Now, that's someone I'd like to meet. Just think—combine his reach with my charm, and we're unstoppable! Totally a win-win situation!","source_cn":"哎呀呀，你认识我的同行？那可一定要让我见见，他的资源也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x470F049CD5C9594E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041532611:1":{"text":"Go find him yourself.","source_cn":"自己找他去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35DE268675B74CF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041532612:1":{"text":"And stay out of my way.","source_cn":"还有，别在我眼前晃。血薇帮需要可靠的情报没错，但我认得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E7DF1124DFE978D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041532613:1":{"text":"You might know things, but your type's not exactly... trustworthy.","source_cn":"那不是一双诚实的手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94B44310695F6152","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041532614:1":{"text":"... Sharp as a dagger, aren't you?","source_cn":"……呀，您真是明察秋毫、慧眼如炬！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38BA912766AB325B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041532615:1":{"text":"But I get it, I get it. I'll track down this Sinbad fellow, maybe toss a few drinks back with him...","source_cn":"那、我，就先走了——找您刚才说的那位叫辛巴达的兄弟多喝几杯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3288C8E72920AEBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041532616:1":{"text":"Heh. Poor Sinbad won't know what hit him.","source_cn":"……有意思，辛巴达那小子这次棋逢敌手了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A5F0A6DD68D6CE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041532617:1":{"text":"This might actually be fun.","source_cn":"会是一出好戏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AFEC10D49584023","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿德":{"text":"Odie","source":"阿德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢卡":{"text":"Lucca","source":"卢卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":2}}